    },
    {
      "displayText": "我開始了用坐騎山羊的運輸服務，\n但我家孩子們的尺寸都算小巧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211958B59CB4E86752857509A0E5C717F8A7684904B8F38670D52D9FF0C000A4F4662115BB65B695B50501176845C3A5BF890FD7B975C0F5DE7300200100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是有更大隻的坐騎山羊，\n就能搬運大型行李了～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F670966F4592796BB768457509A0E5C717F8AFF0C000A5C3180FD642C904B5927578B884C674E4E86FF5E00100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我說<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有XL尺寸的坐騎山羊，\n可以把牠讓給我嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n「查看能力」應該就能知道\n寶可夢的尺寸了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAA00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF015982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B367090058004C5C3A5BF8768457509A0E5C717F8AFF0C000A53EF4EE5628A72608B937D66621155CEFF1F00100001BE01000A300C67E5770B80FD529B300D61C98A725C3180FD77E59053000A5BF653EF592276845C3A5BF84E86FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意把XL尺寸的\n坐騎山羊讓給我了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F628A0058004C5C3A5BF87684000A57509A0E5C717F8A8B937D6662114E8655CEFF1F00100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請收下！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB65364E0BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦！\n是哪隻坐騎山羊呀！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF01000A662F54EA96BB57509A0E5C717F8A5440FF01FF1F00100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳捉到了XL尺寸的坐騎山羊，\n就把牠讓給我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B3634952304E860058004C5C3A5BF8768457509A0E5C717F8AFF0C000A5C31628A72608B937D6662115427FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那傢伙不是XL尺寸呀。\n拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳給我更大尺寸的坐騎山羊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A350A24F194E0D662F0058004C5C3A5BF854403002000A62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B37D66621166F459275C3A5BF8768457509A0E5C717F8A300200100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦！好大一隻坐騎山羊！\n名副其實的XL尺寸！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF01597D59274E0096BB57509A0E5C717F8AFF01000A540D526F51765BE676840058004C5C3A5BF8FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的天！這是什麼尺寸！？\n比我想像的還要大太多啦！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845929FF019019662F4EC09EBC5C3A5BF8FF01FF1F000A6BD4621160F350CF7684908489815927592A591A5566FF01FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看起來能搬運很多行李！\n我可期待你囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B8D774F8680FD642C904B5F88591A884C674EFF01000A621153EF671F5F854F6056C9FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咩咩～咩！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A954A9FF5E54A9FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……唔咩。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026551454A930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀！當然，\n我沒有忘記你們啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0175767136FF0C000A62116C9267095FD88A184F6050115566FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你們都是曾經的山羊速多樂，\n對這城市熟得不能再熟。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就拜託你們把這城市的大大小小\n告訴新來的坐騎山羊囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60501190FD662F66FE7D9376845C717F8A901F591A6A02FF0C000A5C0D901957CE5E02719F5F974E0D80FD518D719F300200100001BE01000A5C3162DC8A174F605011628A901957CE5E027684592759275C0F5C0F000A544A8A3465B04F86768457509A0E5C717F8A56C9FF0100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
